  "scope": [
    "Fresh loopback PostgreSQL and a synthetic signed issuer via the existing API fixture. The hosted API, restricted processor, Oban queue, and canonical development listener ran unmodified. The API and processor each booted through MixerHosted.Application in separate phases against the same database.",
